          "tags": "non-gatecse,web-technologies,ugcnetcse-june2012-paper2",
          "category": "Web Technologies"
        },
        {
          "contents": "",
          "post_id": "55888",
          "text": "\n<p>Reliability of software is directly dependent on</p>\n\n<ol style=\"list-style-type: upper-alpha;\"><li>quality of the design</li>\n    <li>number of errors present</li>\n    <li>software engineers experience</li>\n    <li>user requirement</li>\n</ol>\n",
