          "category": "Web Technologies"
        },
        {
          "contents": "",
          "post_id": "55890",
          "text": "\n<p>&nbsp;_____ is a satellite based tracking system that enables the determination of person&rsquo;s position</p>\n\n<ol style=\"list-style-type: upper-alpha;\"><li>Bluetooth</li>\n    <li>WAP</li>\n    <li>Short Message Service</li>\n    <li>Global Positioning System</li>\n</ol>\n",
