        },
        {
          "contents": "",
          "post_id": "55891",
          "text": "\n<p>A complete micro computer system consists of</p>\n\n<ol style=\"list-style-type: upper-alpha;\"><li>Microprocessor</li>\n    <li>Memory</li>\n    <li>Peripheral equipment</li>\n    <li>All of the above</li>\n</ol>\n",
