          "text": "\n<p>Where does a computer add and compare data?</p>\n\n<ol style=\"list-style-type: upper-alpha;\"><li>Hard disk</li>\n    <li>Floppy disk</li>\n    <li>CPU chip</li>\n    <li>Memory chip</li>\n</ol>\n",
