          "text": "\n<p>Pipelining strategy is called implement</p>\n\n<ol style=\"list-style-type: upper-alpha;\"><li>instruction execution</li>\n    <li>instruction prefetch</li>\n    <li>instruction decoding</li>\n    <li>instruction manipulation</li>\n</ol>\n",
